{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gladiator Reborn</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the bloodstained sands where glory and death dance together. Blood of The Tyrant delivers visceral survivor gameplay wrapped in a haunting blend of Roman grandeur and futuristic nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086440/extras/1a3d9c647a87300ee96dd92362bf77d5.poster.avif?t=1765746840\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086440/extras/1a3d9c647a87300ee96dd92362bf77d5.webm?t=1765746840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086440/extras/1a3d9c647a87300ee96dd92362bf77d5.mp4?t=1765746840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Gladiatorial Combat</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat system that emphasizes weapon weight and tactical precision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel every clash, every victory, every desperate survival moment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill progression that reflects gladiatorial mastery</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Techno-Roman Arena</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive fusion of ancient Rome with futuristic technology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight before roaring crowds in spectacular arena environments</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gladiator's Curse</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overthrow the Tyrant only to inherit his corrupt throne</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore themes of freedom, power, and the price of victory</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086440/extras/43d7db54b534d6329df8333559b3a710.poster.avif?t=1765746840\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086440/extras/43d7db54b534d6329df8333559b3a710.webm?t=1765746840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086440/extras/43d7db54b534d6329df8333559b3a710.mp4?t=1765746840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood of The Tyrant</strong> delivers authentic gladiatorial combat through a roguelike structure that makes every arena run feel like a fight for your life. This isn't about mindless survival - it's about mastering the brutal art of arena warfare as a manufactured warrior fighting for freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gladiatorial Excellence:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena Combat:</strong> Multiple arenas where waves of enemies test your gladiatorial skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Mastery:</strong> Level up during runs with temporary upgrades, build permanent strength in your armory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weighted Combat System:</strong> Every weapon swing, parry, and strike feels deliberate and impactful</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Encounters:</strong> Face legendary champions after surviving brutal waves</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The True Cost of Victory:</strong> Face the ultimate gladiator's paradox - fight for freedom only to discover that liberation means becoming the oppressor. Experience the cycle that has trapped warriors for generations in this techno-Roman nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train. Fight. Conquer. Rule.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3086440?t=1765746840","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086440/81139d818e3691ce3f8740a591d7a5d0cd6d53e8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765746840","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086440/56818adc511c5301959666ef835206056a767b63/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765746840","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086440/56818adc511c5301959666ef835206056a767b63/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765746840","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gladiator Reborn</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the bloodstained sands where glory and death dance together. Blood of The Tyrant delivers visceral survivor gameplay wrapped in a haunting blend of Roman grandeur and futuristic nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086440/extras/1a3d9c647a87300ee96dd92362bf77d5.poster.avif?t=1765746840\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086440/extras/1a3d9c647a87300ee96dd92362bf77d5.webm?t=1765746840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086440/extras/1a3d9c647a87300ee96dd92362bf77d5.mp4?t=1765746840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Gladiatorial Combat</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat system that emphasizes weapon weight and tactical precision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel every clash, every victory, every desperate survival moment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill progression that reflects gladiatorial mastery</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Techno-Roman Arena</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive fusion of ancient Rome with futuristic technology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight before roaring crowds in spectacular arena environments</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gladiator's Curse</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overthrow the Tyrant only to inherit his corrupt throne</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore themes of freedom, power, and the price of victory</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086440/extras/43d7db54b534d6329df8333559b3a710.poster.avif?t=1765746840\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086440/extras/43d7db54b534d6329df8333559b3a710.webm?t=1765746840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086440/extras/43d7db54b534d6329df8333559b3a710.mp4?t=1765746840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood of The Tyrant</strong> delivers authentic gladiatorial combat through a roguelike structure that makes every arena run feel like a fight for your life. This isn't about mindless survival - it's about mastering the brutal art of arena warfare as a manufactured warrior fighting for freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gladiatorial Excellence:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena Combat:</strong> Multiple arenas where waves of enemies test your gladiatorial skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Mastery:</strong> Level up during runs with temporary upgrades, build permanent strength in your armory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weighted Combat System:</strong> Every weapon swing, parry, and strike feels deliberate and impactful</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Encounters:</strong> Face legendary champions after surviving brutal waves</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The True Cost of Victory:</strong> Face the ultimate gladiator's paradox - fight for freedom only to discover that liberation means becoming the oppressor. Experience the cycle that has trapped warriors for generations in this techno-Roman nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train. Fight. Conquer. Rule.</p>","developers":["Zenmasters Studio P.S.A. "],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086440/09fdf81ed6169121d2c44615166bb758a8ce2969/header.jpg?t=1765746840","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Blood of the Tyrant","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen\u2122 3 1200 / Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i3-8100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae GTX 1050 4GB / AMD Radeon\u2122 RX 560 4GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","reco